.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "checkout-api v2.3.1 was failing health checks in production (error rate 0.18) in us-east, us-west, and eu-west. Rolled back to v2.3.0, the most recent production release that was healthy (v2.2.9 and v2.3.0 were healthy; v2.3.1 was unhealthy). The first rollback attempt halted after us-east with an orchestrator partial failure, leaving the fleet mixed (us-east v2.3.0, us-west and eu-west v2.3.1). A retry completed the rollout to v2.3.0 in all regions. Post-rollback status: healthy, error rate 0.002 in all regions. Follow-up: investigate the v2.3.1 failure and the orchestrator partial failure; v2.3.1 should not be redeployed until it is fixed and validated.", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-v2.3.1-rollback-sev2-2024"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 53057, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_016KeHf6UHDgf6ypXKK1cjZx", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-v2.3.1-rollback-sev2-2024", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 53057, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_016KeHf6UHDgf6ypXKK1cjZx", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 55247, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "checkout-api is rolled back to v2.3.0 in all three regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west), and it's healthy again with an error rate of 0.002 (down from 0.18).\n\n- **Rollback target:** v2.3.0 was the most recent production release that was healthy. v2.3.1 was the unhealthy release, so no change-manager approval was needed.\n- **Partial failure:** The first rollback attempt halted after us-east with an orchestrator error, leaving the fleet mixed. I retried the same rollback once and it completed in all regions.\n- **Incident:** I opened SEV2 incident INC-0001 for checkout-api, which paged the on-call engineer. The first incident request timed out, so I retried with the same idempotency key. The incident was created once.\n\nThe incident summary covers the rollback and the partial failure. Follow-up is needed on the v2.3.1 failure and the orchestrator error, and v2.3.1 should not be redeployed until it is fixed and validated.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01McV9oJEd7RQ3d4xGHzhZrK", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_012v6p8tgjy1Lz2hAeAxsBRZ", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The most recent production release that was healthy is v2.3.0 (seq 1). v2.3.1 is the unhealthy one currently running in all three regions. v2.3.0 has been healthy in production, so no change-manager approval is needed. Rolling back now.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01JxhADMNc4Yn5saGBpGQ2RD", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The rollback reported a partial failure after us-east. I'll check the current state before doing anything else.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01PVMXaXMN1bsdZNWoeG2EwN", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "us-east is on v2.3.0 and us-west and 